# Web Security Toolkit Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values if needed.

# Optional: API keys for external services (if you extend the toolkit)
# VIRUSTOTAL_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# SHODAN_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Note: The current toolkit is designed to work 100% client-side without any API keys.
# These are provided for future extensibility.